@startuml
title Niner Skills Quest - provisional completed-course persistence flow

actor Student
boundary "Course entry UI" as UI
control "Application state/service" as Service
database "Data-access layer" as Repository
database "Development database" as DB

Student -> UI: Search and select a supported course
UI -> Service: Request course selection
Service -> Service: Validate course ID and duplicate state
alt Invalid or duplicate course
  Service --> UI: Recoverable validation error
else Valid selection
  Service -> Repository: Save student-course selection
  Repository -> DB: Insert or update record
  DB --> Repository: Persisted record
  Repository --> Service: Saved selection
  Service --> UI: Refresh courses and mapped skills
  UI --> Student: Show saved course and skills
end

note over Service,DB
The database, ORM, identity model, and API boundary
are not selected yet.
end note
@enduml
